==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Let the Cat Base tank for a bit, send out a [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], and defend him with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] as much as you can. Use the Cat Cannon to clear out B.B.Bunnies and damage Gory Dark on occassion.

